  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid Strategic Partnership 2022-2024 (Kenya)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an individual component of the overarching opportunity being developed for the Irish Aid Strategic Partnership 2022-2024 (renewal). IRC Kenya will focus on Pillar 1: GBV Response, Preparedness and Recovery, in which the anticipated outcome is that women and girls in emergencies are protected from and treated for the consequences of Gender Based Violence (GBV).</narrative>
  </description>
